ain by night, and shroud the land in darkness!","steam_appid":2159900,"support_info":{"email":"johan@codearcs.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":"https://codearcs.itch.io/decks-of-the-damned"}